ation lump sum for all employees\n  Employees who relocate at the company's request receive a relocation lump sum of 3000 EUR\n  For employees relocating with dependent children, 500 EUR was added to the standard relocation lump sum\n  This version applied from 2025-02-01 until the day before 2026-02-01\n==\n# HB-18 · Memo: relocation lump sum exceptions\nversion: 1 · status: current · effective: 2025-02-01\n  # HB-18 · Memo: relocation lump sum exceptions\n  This memo lists group exceptions to the relocation lump sum in HB-23\n  For relocations to another country, the relocation lump sum is 5250 EUR instead of the standard amount\n  The exception above does not apply to relocations within the first six months of employment; they follow the standard relocation lump sum in HB-23 §2\n==\n"
